        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: University of Minnesota, Ateneo de Davao University\n- People: Bryan Cupito, Joel E. Tabora\n- Places: Minneapolis, Saint Paul, Minnesota, Cincinnati, Ohio, Manila, Philippines\n- Roles: Jesuit priest, university president, graduate\n\nFacts:\n- Joel E. Tabora was born on September 26, 1947, in Manila, Philippines.\n- Ateneo de Davao University also runs a grade school and a high school.\n- The University of Minnesota, Twin Cities is a public research university in Minneapolis and Saint Paul, Minnesota.\n- Bryan Cupito graduated from McNicholas High School in Cincinnati, Ohio in 2002.\n- Joel E. Tabora is a Jesuit priest and the president of Ateneo de Davao University.\n- Bryan Cupito graduated from the University of Minnesota in 2006.\n- The University of Minnesota, Twin Cities is also referred to as the University of Minnesota, Minnesota, the U of M, UMN, and the U.",
